WEBVTT

00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:30.538
Almost everyone feels down
from time to time.

00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:33.996
Getting a bad grade,
losing a job, having an argument,

00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:37.329
even a rainy day can bring on
feelings of sadness.

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:39.121
Sometimes there's no trigger at all.

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:40.704
It just pops up out of the blue.

00:00:40.746 --> 00:00:44.204
Then circumstances change,
and those sad feelings disappear.

00:00:44.579 --> 00:00:46.454
Clinical depression is different.

00:00:46.496 --> 00:00:48.121
It's a medical disorder,

00:00:48.204 --> 00:00:52.079
and it won't go away
just because you want it to.

00:00:52.162 --> 00:00:54.704
It lingers for at least
two consecutive weeks,

00:00:54.746 --> 00:00:57.954
and significantly interferes
with one's ability to work,

00:00:57.996 --> 00:00:59.996
play, or love.